  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These are the generations of the sons of Noah, Shem, Ham, and Japheth; sons were born to them after the flood.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Japheth: Gomer, Magog, Madai, Javan, Tubal, Meshech, and Tiras. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Gomer: Ashkenaz, Riphath, and Togarmah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Javan: Elishah, Tarshish, Kittim, and Dodanim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "From these the coastland peoples spread. These are the sons of Japheth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10.5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Compare verses 20,31. Heb lacks",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "These are the sons of Japheth",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " in their lands, each with his own language, by their families, in their nations.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Ham: Cush, Egypt, Put, and Canaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Cush: Seba, Havilah, Sabtah, Raamah, and Sabteca. The sons of Raamah: Sheba and Dedan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cush became the father of Nimrod; he was the first on earth to be a mighty man. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He was a mighty hunter before the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; therefore it is said, “Like Nimrod a mighty hunter before the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The beginning of his kingdom was Babel, Erech, and Accad, all of them in the land of Shinar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "From that land he went into Assyria, and built Nineveh, Rehoboth-Ir, Calah, and ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Resen between Nineveh and Calah; that is the great city. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egypt became the father of Ludim, Anamim, Lehabim, Naph-tuhim, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pathrusim, Casluhim (whence came the Philistines), and Caphtorim.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Canaan became the father of Sidon his first-born, and Heth, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and the Jebusites, the Amorites, the Girgashites, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the Hivites, the Arkites, the Sinites, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the Arvadites, the Zemarites, and the Hamathites. Afterward the families of the Canaanites spread abroad. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the territory of the Canaanites extended from Sidon, in the direction of Gerar, as far as Gaza, and in the direction of Sodom, Gomorrah, Admah, and Zeboiim, as far as Lasha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These are the sons of Ham, by their families, their languages, their lands, and their nations.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Shem also, the father of all the children of Eber, the elder brother of Japheth, children were born. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Shem: Elam, Asshur, Arpachshad, Lud, and Aram. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Aram: Uz, Hul, Gether, and Mash. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arpachshad became the father of Shelah; and Shelah became the father of Eber. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Eber were born two sons: the name of the one was Peleg,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10.25",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "That is",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Division",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " for in his days the earth was divided, and his brother's name was Joktan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joktan became the father of Almodad, Sheleph, Hazarmaveth, Jerah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hadoram, Uzal, Diklah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obal, Abima-el, Sheba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ophir, Havilah, and Jobab; all these were the sons of Joktan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The territory in which they lived extended from Mesha in the direction of Sephar to the hill country of the east. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These are the sons of Shem, by their families, their languages, their lands, and their nations.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.10.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
